  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Can you please add [VIE] TAG  as an option for choosing Vietnamese language in the language box? (In the picture)\nAnd also could you consider add a Vietnamese channels in VRChat discord?\nThe Vietnamese VRChat community has a Discord channel with 500+ members (https://discord.gg/85kby4j)\nWe even have Facebook community for VRChat (https://www.facebook.com/groups/vrchatvn)\nAlso, we have A LOT OF Vietnamese maps on VRChat\n- VIETNAM˸ VIET NAM - JAPAN\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_ad956d9f-ffef-4afb-befc-f7edcc7712a9\n- VIETNAM˸ HA LONG BAY\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_13d3626f-cad1-45d1-abed-e14f972f749e\n- VIETNAM˸ VIETNAMESE HOUSE\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_3dd6a5a0-a578-4fb6-8e94-22db822f574a\n- VIETNAM˸ VIETNAMESE HIGH SCHOOL\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_96c22298-17ad-4ca5-bb49-5f4721799016\n- VIETNAM˸ HOI AN OLD TOWN\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_32a4e59b-aeac-41c8-a790-ef81cea2ae01\n- VIETNAM˸ NOTRE-DAME CATHEDRAL BASILICA OF SAIGON  \nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_882becdf-a4a3-45d8-8cfb-5eddbd727b51\nThere is a similar post in May with 63 votes up but being ignored.\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/make-option-for-choosing-vietnamese-language\nAnd also a similar post on ask.vrchat.com\nhttps://ask.vrchat.com/t/vrchat-vietnamese-community/2900\nSo PLEASE, could you add a tag for Vietnamese language and Vietnamese Channel on VRChat Discord. Please, please, please\n\n(Just for side information, at around the same time, Romanian Community has the same request and has been approved at the end of July)\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/vrchat-romanian-community",
